==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{m|la|diēs||day}} and {{m|la|Martis}}, genitive of {{m|la|Mars}}.

===Noun===
{{la-noun|diēs Martis|diēī Martis|f|fifth}}

# [[Tuesday]]

